<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Helpless I am, and full of guilt;</l><l>But yet for me Thy blood was spilt,</l><l>And Thou canst make me what Thou wilt,</l><l>And take me as I am.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>No preparation can I make,</l><l>My best resolves I only break,</l><l>Yet save me for Thine own Name’s sake,</l><l>And take me as I am.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Behold me, Savior, at Thy feet,</l><l>Deal with me as Thou seest meet;</l><l>Thy work begin, Thy work complete,</l><l>But take me as I am.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
